$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~24 min | Difficulty: Hard]] The fleet strikes at the Cylon staging area in Ostrava Reach: a damaged basestar, its raider screen and a second basestar still jumping in. Red flight leads Blue flight and the Halyard in. The Theseus arrives for the second round.", -1)
$end_multi_text

